Type: Package
Package: coriell
Title: Convenience Functions for Bioinformatics
Version: 0.20.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gennaro", "Calendo", , "gcalendo@coriell.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Coriell Institute for Medical Research", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Helper functions for common bioinformatics tasks such as
    plotting and summarizing the results of differential expression
    analyses, creating heatmaps from expression data, performing
    permutation tests, selecting outliers, performing gene ontology
    enrichment with the 'PANTHER' web service, and visualizing principal
    component analysis and 'UMAP' embeddings.
